committer konrad-metric <konrad@metric.xyz> 1781708634 +0200

Add pool getSellAndBuyPrices and align price provider token accessors.
(This is modified: https://github.com/Metric-OMM/metric-core/pull/55/changes )

Important changes:
   - getSellAndBuyPrices - fee-adjusted live sell/buy Q64.64 quotes at current bin position with oracle spread, per-bin fees, and notional fee matching exact-in swap
   - IMetricOmmPool - expose getSellAndBuyPrices on pool interface
   - IPriceProvider - replace getTokens with separate token0 and token1 accessors
   - MetricOmmPoolFactory - validate price provider pair via token0 and token1
   - getSellAndBuyPrices tests - quote vs realized swap coverage including notional fee
   - anchor E2E tests - faithful anchored oracle/provider path through pool swap and getSellAndBuyPrices

Small changes:
    - add FaithfulAnchor test mocks; update MockPriceProvider, MockOracle, SwapInBin, and SwapMathBenchmark mocks for token0/token1; refresh factory validation comment
